(7737098, 1275555, 173844, '<td valign="top">In addition to the majestic, wild beauty of the scene, the "meeting of glaciers" is momentous in its vastness and actual impact, in its ineluctable inevitability.  You can almost feel the reverberations deep within.  The downward movement of the glaciers means that a fork in the road is not encountered, but the tines meld into a handle.  Can''t quite put a finger on the therefore of this.<br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'In addition to the majestic, wild beauty of the scene, the "meeting of glaciers" is momentous in its vastness and actual impact, in its ineluctable inevitability.  You can almost feel the reverberations deep within.  The downward movement of the glaciers means that a fork in the road is not encountered, but the tines meld into a handle.  Can''t quite put a finger on the therefore of this.Personal favorite of the challenge.', '2023-01-22 21:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7737099, 1275557, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely demonstration of the challenge.  The choice is made and the future is that much more determined.  Autumn colors brim over.  New adventures await.</td>', 'Lovely demonstration of the challenge.  The choice is made and the future is that much more determined.  Autumn colors brim over.  New adventures await.', '2023-01-22 21:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7737100, 1275559, 173844, '<td valign="top">Three ways!  Through the gate at a border into the mist, or downhill, or whatever else. The monks are at this spot.  Plying the Way that isn''t a way.  Wandering like clouds.  Wonderful image.</td>', 'Three ways!  Through the gate at a border into the mist, or downhill, or whatever else. The monks are at this spot.  Plying the Way that isn''t a way.  Wandering like clouds.  Wonderful image.', '2023-01-22 21:38:12.000000', NULL, 1),
